        { "text", text = "|cOXP_PICK_The Undercity|r" },
        { "text", text = "Walk south from Brill to the Ruins of Lordaeron and down into the Undercity. |cOXP_ENEMY_Lady Sylvanas Windrunner|r holds court in the |cOXP_PICK_Royal Quarter|r; |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tanis Alderwood|r begs in the |cOXP_PICK_Trade Quarter|r." },
