        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r" },
        { "text", text = "Back to Bandarion Keep. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Danitha Morr|r gives you the |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r; |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Deathguard Billmuth|r waits downstairs in the keep. If you lose the symbol, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Danitha Morr|r gives you another." },
