      { only = "Paladin",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Deathguard Falgan|r" },
        { "text", text = "Venomweb Vale is at the far east end of the glades, a long walk. Falgan lies dead among the Scarlet Crusaders there: target his body and use the |cOXP_LOOT_Symbol of Life|r, then talk to him at once, as he does not stay alive long. If he is already up (another player), just talk to him; if he died again, raise him again." },
