        { "text", text = "Hex of Weakness: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Aelthalyste|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 10 in the Undercity, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Aelthalyste|r, the priest trainer in the |cOXP_PICK_War Quarter|r, hands you a Hex of Weakness letter for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ur'kyo|r in Orgrimmar (the zeppelin from the tower outside the Undercity)." },
