        { "target", name = "Mathrengyl Bearwalker" },
      },
      { only = "NightElf Druid",
        { "text", text = "Moonglade" },
        { "text", text = "Cast Teleport: Moonglade: it lands you beside the building where |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Dendrite Starblaze|r stands upstairs, past the armor vendor. The Great Bear Spirit sits in the woods to the north-west. Speak to it and go through all of its words (what it represents, the strength of the body, the strength of the heart, then ask for its blessing): the talk is the objective, there is no fight. It blends into the ground, has no quest mark and gives off a faint blue-grey glow by a group of three trees: from Nighthaven go west along the foot of the northern mountains, through the gap between the trees and the hills. If |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Dendrite Starblaze|r is missing when you return, step outside and cast Teleport: Moonglade again. Learn the Moonglade flight path (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sindrayl|r, south of the lake) for later, then take |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Silva Fil'naveth|r's flight from the middle of Nighthaven: she flies druids straight to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed. Take the portal up to Darnassus." },
        { "goto", x = 56.21, y = 30.64, zone = "1450" },
        { "turnin", quest = 5921, text = "Turn in Moonglade" },
        { "target", name = "Dendrite Starblaze" },
