      { only = "NightElf Druid",
        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_PICK_Moonkin Stone|r" },
        { "text", text = "Fly from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine. The |cOXP_PICK_Moonkin Stone|r stands inside the nearest moonkin cave east of the village: the northern of two small rock-pile caves where the Auberdine road meets the main north-south road. Moonkin (level 11-13) stand outside, the cave is empty: slip past them. Use the |cOXP_LOOT_Cenarion Moondust|r by the stone: Lunaclaw (level 12-13) walks in towards you and stays three minutes. Kill her, then speak to the |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Lunaclaw Spirit|r that appears and ask for the strength of her body and heart: the talk is the credit. Another druid's Lunaclaw gives you the spirit too." },
