      {
        { "text", text = "The Disruption Ends" },
        { "text", text = "Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; |cOXP_ENEMY_Kreenig Snarlsnout|r walks among them.\nCareful: Razormane Flesheaters and Berserkers (18-19) are elites in the camp's north-east, near |cOXP_ENEMY_Kreenig Snarlsnout|r: pull |cOXP_ENEMY_Kreenig Snarlsnout|r and the quilboar away from them one at a time." },
