      {
        { "text", text = "Harpy Lieutenants" },
        { "text", text = "North-west to the Dry Hills: the Witchwing Slayers hold their western end; they wear the rings.\nCareful: Some stealthed harpy ambushers wait in the area and stay hidden until you get close. A level 19 elite harpy also patrols there." },
