      {
        { "text", text = "Raptor Horns" },
        { "text", text = "On the way east to Echeyakee: Sunscale Scytheclaws prowl the plains east of the Dry Hills; any of them can drop an |cOXP_LOOT_Intact Raptor Horn|r for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mebok Mizzyrix|r in Ratchet." },
        { "goto", x = 44.1, y = 14.4, zone = "1413" },
