        { "text", text = "Fly from the Crossroads to Thunder Bluff. Apothecary Zamah waits in the Pools of Vision, the cave under Spirit Rise: hand in the spores there first, while their time runs. Then |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Turak Runetotem|r trains you on Elder Rise." },
