      { only = "Tauren Druid/Skyborne Druid",
        { "text", text = "Trial of the Lake" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Dendrite Starblaze|r stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. The Shrine Baubles lie on the bed of Lake Elune'ara and fade within minutes: swim one straight to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it there and speak to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tajarri|r. Trial of the Lake runs on a timer: no teleport or Hearthstone until |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tajarri|r has it." },
