        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_PICK_Strange Lockbox|r lies at the north edge of the Sludge Fen, by the Venture Co. tower. It holds the |cOXP_LOOT_Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility|r for Trial of the Sea Lion." },
