        { "text", text = "Fenris Isle lies in the lake north-east of the Sepulcher. The gnolls' pyre, with the |cOXP_PICK_Charred Remains|r, is on its shore: click the remains to hand in, and click them again for the next quest. The body is a tauren's, not the elf's." },
