      { only = "Paladin",
        { "text", text = "Fenris Keep" },
        { "text", text = "Lumina Windsinger is caged in the basement of Fenris Keep, at the north end of the isle. The Rot Hide gnolls (level 18-19) fill the keep: they pull in big groups across floors and players report very fast respawns, so clear a path and keep moving. Any of them can carry the |cOXP_LOOT_Fenris Isle Key|r (often the first kill); the rare |cOXP_ENEMY_Rot Hide Bruiser|r (22) and Snarlmane (23) can too. If her cage is empty, another player is escorting her: wait for her to come back." },
        { "goto", x = 65.55, y = 23.27, zone = "1421" },
        { "turnin", quest = 91861, text = "Turn in Into Fenris Keep" },
