      {
        { "text", text = "Hezrul Bloodmark" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_ENEMY_Hezrul Bloodmark|r leads the Kolkar on the west shore of Lushwater Oasis, south of |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Regthar Deathgate|r. He walks that shore, from about 46,36 in the north to 46,42 in the south: if he isn't at the arrow, follow the shore until you meet him. Hand his head to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Regthar Deathgate|r on your last Crossroads stop. Oasis Snapjaws crawl in the oasis' water there: their shells are for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tonga Runetotem|r." },
        { "goto", x = 46, y = 41.1, zone = "1413" },
