      {
        { "text", text = "Field of Giants" },
        { "text", text = "South of Camp Taurajo, the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants; the eggs lie in them, and Silithid Swarmers come out to defend them.\nCareful: Silithid Swarmers in the area release many tiny adds that interrupt spells; damage shields such as Thorns kill them in one hit." },
