      },
      { only = "Warrior",
        { "text", text = "Satyr Hooves" },
        { "text", text = "The satyrs of Satyrnaar, north-east of Splintertree Post (Xavian, level 28-30), and the Felmusk satyrs north-west of the post (25-27) drop a hoof four kills in five. A Xavian satyr at 15% health may cast Gift of the Xavian and heal to full: finish it fast or stun it. Hellcallers throw Fireballs from 40 yards; Felmusk satyrs reek in melee and run for help at 15%." },
        { "goto", x = 78.29, y = 45.29, zone = "1440" },
