      {
        { "text", text = "Vorsha the Lasher" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Muglash|r walks north up the strand to a naga brazier. Put the brazier out, then guard him through the naga waves until Vorsha is dead; the Wrathtail naga drop the heads |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Marukai|r wants." },
