      {
        { "text", text = "Thistlefur Hold" },
        { "text", text = "Inside the hold, Troll Chests lie along the tunnels. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ruul Snowhoof|r is held deep inside: free him and protect him all the way out, then he runs home to Night Run.\nCareful: Two scripted ambushes occur, each made up of three Thistlefurs (a Shaman, a Pathfinder and an Avenger, Ursa or Den Watcher): the first when you come back to the tunnel's fork inside the cave, the second just beyond the gate where |cOXP_ENEMY_Dal Bloodclaw|r roams." },
        { "goto", x = 39.88, y = 34.17, zone = "1440" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 6462, text = "Troll Charm: 8 (Below ground)" },
