        { "text", text = "The Ravenclaw undead haunt the ruins of Beren's Peril, east of the road in the south-east of the forest; a |cOXP_ENEMY_Ravenclaw Guardian|r drops the |cOXP_LOOT_Note Scrap|r that leads to the |cOXP_PICK_Offering Stone|r.\nAn elite spirit (20) often stands beside the |cOXP_PICK_Offering Stone|r: pull the Ravenclaws away from the stone before you fight them." },
        { "accept", quest = 95884, text = "Accept The Offering Stone (|cOXP_LOOT_Note Scrap|r, from a |cOXP_ENEMY_Ravenclaw Guardian|r)" },
