        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Doan Karhan|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Doan Karhan|r camps beside |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Takar the Seer|r, at a tent just north-east of Camp Taurajo in the southern Barrens. Alliance warlocks reach him from Ratchet or Theramore; Horde ones head south from the Crossroads. He wants fragments from two dungeons: take the quest before your Blackfathom Deeps and Shadowfang Keep runs." },
