        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kil'hala|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kil'hala|r, a troll tailor, works at the Crossroads. The robe gives intellect, stamina and spirit; the tunic more intellect and stamina but no spirit." },
