      {
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_ENEMY_Tideress|r" },
        { "text", text = "Back south-west to Mystral Lake. |cOXP_ENEMY_Tideress|r, a corrupted water elemental, drifts around the lake's island and under the water. She drops the |cOXP_LOOT_Befouled Water Globe|r only once you have Stonetalon Standstill from |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mastok Wrilehiss|r; it starts a quest for Splintertree." },
