        { "text", text = "Galak centaurs" },
        { "text", text = "The Galak camps fill the canyon north of Freewind; Scouts, Wranglers and Windchasers share every camp. A lone |cOXP_ENEMY_Galak Messenger|r walks a long path between the camps: if you meet him, kill him, his note starts a quest for Whitereach Post. Don't wait for him." },
