        { "text", text = "West of Whitereach the wyverns nest on the Highperch cliffs; the eggs lie in the nests. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Pao'ka Swiftmountain|r waits on the east side of the nesting grounds: free him and keep him alive on the walk back to Whitereach Post.\nCareful: Wyverns at level 28-29 fly overhead and can be pulled without warning. A group of three wyverns can ambush you once you pass the first pillar at the bottom." },
