        { "text", text = "South-west, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-32) fill the Foothill Caverns in the hills west of Tarren Mill; about one in sixteen carries the rod. Stay in these caverns: the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) of the cave further north carry it too, but at 29-30 they hit hard and come in pairs." },
