        { "text", text = "Tarren Mill's Prison Break In, Stone Tokens and The Hammer May Fall are offered from level 30. Below it? Keep killing the yetis in these caves until level 30. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Graveyard) or the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon instead." },
