      {
        { "text", text = "Foothill Caverns" },
        { "text", text = "Back into the yeti caves west of Tarren Mill with the |cOXP_LOOT_Rod of Helcular|r. The path splits just inside: the |cOXP_PICK_Flame of Azel|r burns on the upper level to the right, the |cOXP_PICK_Flame of Veraz|r on the lower level to the left, past more yetis." },
