      { only = "Human Warlock",
        { "text", text = "Class quest: {item:6900}" },
        { "text", text = "In Search of Menara Voidrender (Stormwind)" },
        { "text", text = "At 31 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Demisette Cloyce|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Slaughtered Lamb|r, in the |cOXP_PICK_Mage Quarter|r, sends you to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Menara Voidrender|r in Ratchet. Buy a |cOXP_LOOT_Robes of Arcana|r and a |cOXP_LOOT_Gold Bar|r first (next steps) to save a trip." },
