      },
      { only = "Warlock",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Menara Voidrender|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Menara Voidrender|r stands by |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Strahad Farsan|r's tower on the hill above Ratchet, behind the engineers' hut. She takes the robe, then sends the gold bar to |cOXP_ENEMY_Xizk Goodstitch|r in Booty Bay." },
