      {
        { "text", text = "Witherbark Village" },
        { "text", text = "South of Hammerfall, the Witherbark trolls hold the village in the hills. Axe Throwers guard the outer huts; the Witch Doctors and Headhunters hold the heart of the village. Careful: All three troll types flee for help at 15% health, which can pull more trolls from the nearby camps." },
