        { "text", text = "Level 33" },
        { "text", text = "Shadowprey's Hand of Iruxos and the coast's naga want 33. Below that? The Scorpashi Lashers on the slopes north of |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Smeed Scrabblescrew|r's camp are on your way west: kill them until level 33. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Library) instead." },
