      {
        { "text", text = "Ethel Rethor" },
        { "text", text = "Head north along the coast, then inland to the ruined tower of Ethel Rethor: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Azore Aldamort|r waits inside. The coast's clams and naga come after Thunder Axe Fortress, on one walk north to Ranazjar Isle." },
