      },
      {
        { "text", text = "Thunder Axe Fortress" },
        { "text", text = "Head east to Thunder Axe Fortress. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the |cOXP_LOOT_Burning Gem|r on it before it dies to fill one |cOXP_LOOT_Infused Burning Gem|r. The |cOXP_ENEMY_Burning Blade Seer|r stands on the fortress's top floor with the Sceptre. The cultists also drop a |cOXP_LOOT_Flayed Demon Skin|r now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it. Hand of Iruxos: clear the middle of the largest building, then use the |cOXP_LOOT_Demon Pick|r on the red |cOXP_PICK_Hand of Iruxos Crystal|r there. A |cOXP_ENEMY_Demon Spirit|r (37) comes out: kill it for the |cOXP_LOOT_Demon Box|r." },
        { "goto", x = 55, y = 26.5, zone = "1443" },
