      { only = "Warlock",
        { "text", text = "Choose an acolyte" },
        { "text", text = "Pick one acolyte: you can take only one of their quests. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Acolyte Wytula|r's felhound path ends with the Orb or |cOXP_LOOT_Staff of Dar'Orahil|r, the shadow versions; |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Acolyte Magaz|r's infernal path with the Orb or |cOXP_LOOT_Staff of Noh'Orahil|r, much the same items on the fire side. Most warlocks lean on shadow, but compare the four in their tooltips first. The guide follows the one you take. Keep the ruby or the emerald: it is handed back." },
        { "goto", x = 62.64, y = 35.3, zone = "1413" },
        { "accept", quest = 4962, text = "Accept Shard of a Felhound (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Acolyte Wytula|r: she gives you the |cOXP_LOOT_Felhas Ruby|r)" },
        { "target", name = "Acolyte Wytula" },
        { "goto", x = 62.56, y = 35.23, zone = "1413" },
        { "accept", quest = 4963, text = "Accept Shard of an Infernal (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Acolyte Magaz|r: he gives you the |cOXP_LOOT_Infus Emerald|r)" },
        { "target", name = "Acolyte Magaz" },
      },
      { only = "Warlock",
        { "text", text = "Mannoroc Coven" },
        { "text", text = "Mannoroc Coven fills south-central Desolace, east of Shadowprey Village. The Burning Blade Summoners (level 38-39, warlocks with imps) carry the |cOXP_LOOT_Infernal Orb|r every time. For the spirit, bring your demon to low health with your damage over time, then channel the ruby or the emerald on it and keep channelling while it dies, as with Drain Soul: the gem does no damage of its own. The ruby works on the coven's felhounds: the two Mana Eaters (37-38) in the north, and the Mage Hunters (38) and Ley Hunters (39) further south. The emerald works on the Lesser Infernals (36-37, sixteen of them, fire-resistant)." },
        { "goto", x = 66.49, y = 77.94, zone = "1443" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 1799, text = "Infernal Orb: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Infernal Orb|r, from the Burning Blade Summoners)" },
        { "mob", name = "Burning Blade Summoner" },
        { "goto", x = 52.91, y = 68.14, zone = "1443" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 4962, text = "Imprisoned Felhound Spirit: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Imprisoned Felhound Spirit|r, from a |cOXP_ENEMY_Mana Eater|r, |cOXP_ENEMY_Mage Hunter|r or |cOXP_ENEMY_Ley Hunter|r)" },
        { "mob", name = "Mana Eater" },
        { "goto", x = 54.31, y = 71.14, zone = "1443" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 4963, text = "Imprisoned Infernal Spirit: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Imprisoned Infernal Spirit|r, from a |cOXP_ENEMY_Lesser Infernal|r)" },
        { "mob", name = "Lesser Infernal" },
      },
      { only = "Warlock",
        { "text", text = "The demon's spirit" },
        { "text", text = "Back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Menara Voidrender|r in the tower above Ratchet with the spirit and the gem first: her orb follows from it." },
        { "goto", x = 62.51, y = 35.45, zone = "1413" },
        { "turnin", quest = 4962, text = "Turn in Shard of a Felhound" },
        { "target", name = "Menara Voidrender" },
        { "goto", x = 62.51, y = 35.45, zone = "1413" },
        { "turnin", quest = 4963, text = "Turn in Shard of an Infernal" },
        { "target", name = "Menara Voidrender" },
      },
      { only = "Warlock",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r lives at her farm in the middle of Dustwallow Marsh, south of the road from the Barrens and south-west of Theramore; a spirit healer stands beside it. Deadmire, a level 45 crocolisk, patrols the creeks just north-east. Hand in the orb now; Cleansing waits for level 38. Before you accept it, clear the spiders and crocolisks around her paddock. Accepting starts a 3-minute timer: she walks to the paddock and lets the |cOXP_ENEMY_Demon of the Orb|r out. It is elite (level 40): grouping up is encouraged; a warlock of about 40 can solo it with Fear or Banish and damage over time, a level 38 one brings a friend. The timer keeps running after the kill, so hand in at once. If time runs out, abandon the quest and take it from |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Tabetha|r again." },
        { "goto", x = 46.06, y = 57.09, zone = "1445" },
        { "turnin", quest = 1799, text = "Turn in Fragments of the Orb of Orahil" },
        { "target", name = "Tabetha" },
        { "xp", level = 38, text = "Reach level 38" },
