      {
        { "text", text = "Mirage Raceway" },
        { "text", text = "The road from Freewind Post to Tanaris runs past the Mirage Raceway on the Shimmering Flats: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Fizzle Brassbolts|r is in the gnomes' camp beside the track, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Pozzik|r and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Zamek|r by the goblins' camp. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Pozzik|r first, then |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Zamek|r, who runs off to keep Rizzle busy; then take Rizzle's plans from the gnomes' camp and bring them back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Pozzik|r." },
