      {
        { "text", text = "Shaol'watha: kill these as you meet them" },
        { "text", text = "West of the island, the Vilebranch scalpers hold the temples of Agol'watha and Shaol'watha. Slagtree's tools lie at one of the temples.\nThe Silvermane Stalkers, Savage Owlbeasts and Razorbeak Skylords share the hills between the temples and Skulk Rock. Use the |cOXP_LOOT_Wildkin Muisek Vessel|r on the owlbeasts you kill. The Skylords also drop Long Elegant Feathers: keep ten for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Otho Moji'ko|r's second message.\nCareful: Silvermane Stalkers are level 47-48 and stay stealthed while out of combat. Up close they use Infected Bite. When a |cOXP_ENEMY_Silvermane Howler|r falls to 50% health or lower, it calls for help from anything within 25 yd." },
