        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Marvon Rivetseeker|r" },
        { "text", text = "Ride south along the road to the Broken Pillar; |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Marvon Rivetseeker|r camps beside it. From here the road west leads down into Un'Goro Crater, where the next guide starts." },
