        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Loganaar|r" },
        { "text", text = "Cast Teleport: Moonglade. |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Loganaar|r stands in Nighthaven; your class trainer (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Turak Runetotem|r, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Mathrengyl Bearwalker|r or Theridran in Stormwind) offers the same quest." },
