        { "text", text = "A five-player dungeon event: Scholomance lies under Caer Darrow, the island town in the south-east of the Western Plaguelands. In the |cOXP_PICK_The Great Ossuary|r's basement, first clear every mob in the room, then use the |cOXP_LOOT_Divination Scryer|r at its centre: four waves of spirits follow, each closing with an Aspect mini-boss (the first wave weak and slow, the rest elite). Fight in a corner so nothing else joins, and drink between waves: it is long. Then |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Death Knight Darkreaver|r (level 62 elite) appears: he Cleaves, casts Shadow Bolt and Blood Leech, and Dominates a player's mind against the group. His head always drops." },
        { "goto", x = 68.9, y = 75.2, zone = "1422" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8258, text = "Darkreaver's Head: 1" },
      },
      { only = "Shaman",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sagorne Creststrider|r" },
        { "goto", x = 38.66, y = 35.92, zone = "1454" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8258, text = "Turn in The Darkreaver Menace (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sagorne Creststrider|r: 200 Horde reputation; the |cOXP_LOOT_Skyfury Helm|r may be gone)" },
        { "target", name = "Sagorne Creststrider" },
      },
